Spoken World
Copyright 2026 ryannli (https://github.com/ryannli)

This fork is built on spoken-world by ryannli (https://github.com/ryannli/spoken-world), Apache-2.0.
Modifications in this fork: the Gemini provider, Gemini transcription and the whole "Make it real" workflow (in-page video generation, the copy-prompt button, the
previs/real comparison pane and the example clips in app/media) were removed;
the model is now Thinking Machines' Inkling via Tinker, called through the local server (site/serve.js, site/tinker.js); voice input uses the
browser's Web Speech API; the Claude artifact host and the Vercel deployment files were removed.

